{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415760","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415760","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1041576001:1":{"text":"Helthor above! I wasn't imagining things... It really is the Frozen Mother!","source_cn":"赫托啊！我没看错，真的是冬喉女士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1149BFFC2A396885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576002:1":{"text":"Just Alna is fine.","source_cn":"叫我阿尔娜就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8057B3B962F34BD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576003:0":{"text":"Oh no, that wouldn't be right! We dwarves grew up hearing stories about you!","source_cn":"不不不，这样显得太不尊重您了！我们矮人都听过您的传说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC7DDBD45D1F8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576004:0":{"text":"A mighty Celestial warrior who broke through the Hypofiend siege alone and saved Forgetown single-handedly...","source_cn":"一位伟大的半神战士，孤身一人突破了魔物的封锁，拯救了炉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x423BD36611C7AB43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576005:0":{"text":"I wasn't alone. I had a brave dwarf at my side. His name was Ginneas.","source_cn":"我并不是一个人，还有位勇敢的矮人朋友，他叫格尼兹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74B162967E7245D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576006:0":{"text":"Yes! Master Ginneas! He's the one who set the standard for modern weapon forging!","source_cn":"对！格尼兹大师！就是他制定了现在通用的武器锻造工艺规范！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CC8499A1F74D87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576007:0":{"text":"He'd always say that one fight at your side taught him more about weapons than a lifetime at the forge.","source_cn":"他说过，正因曾经有幸与您并肩作战，他才会明白一把合格武...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F6AC0305F5CD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576008:0":{"text":"Truth is, it was his courage that won the day. Steel was just the tool.","source_cn":"他不屈的精神才是致胜的关键。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA544F8049353F0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576009:0":{"text":"And he swore he learned that courage from you!","source_cn":"他也说过！这正是从您身上学到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82B8D99FD8A5F54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576010:1":{"text":"You give me too much credit, child. We only made it through because we had each other's backs.","source_cn":"谬赞了，孩子。是我们相互支撑，才打赢了那场战役。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44016C63D8EB9CA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576011:1":{"text":"Speaking of Ginneas... how's his grandson doing? I haven't been back to Forgetown in ages.","source_cn":"说到格尼兹，他的孙子还好吗？我很久没有回炉卫城了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6903D09425A5C50A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576012:1":{"text":"You mean Master Rolrin? I actually apprenticed under him for a while.","source_cn":"您是说沃尔夫大师吗？我在他的手下当过一段时间学徒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA619F048FDBF397A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576013:1":{"text":"Ah, yes. Red beard, just like his grandfather. Runs in the family.","source_cn":"嗯。他和格尼兹一样，都有着浓密的红色胡须。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA18D21B81D08DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576014:1":{"text":"Well... by the time I met him, his beard had gone completely white.","source_cn":"呃，其实呢，我认识沃尔夫大师时，他已经是个白胡子老爷爷了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x213E2681BBB37E29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576015:1":{"text":"Heh... Time does that to you.","source_cn":"……呵，时间啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C7B466758C2832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576016:1":{"text":"Frozen Mother? I... I didn't say anything wrong, did I?","source_cn":"冬喉女士？我，我应该没有说错什么吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69DCB38B5722AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576017:1":{"text":"You did.","source_cn":"有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B9FC159EAE9696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576018:1":{"text":"Ah?! ","source_cn":"啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0A673969906DD22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576019:1":{"text":"You should just call me Alna.","source_cn":"叫我阿尔娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A86532148E44B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576020:1":{"text":"R-right! Alna, ma'am! If there's ever anything you need, I, and all of Brimstone Village, are at your service!","source_cn":"……好吧，阿尔娜女士！如果您有需要，我和深岩村都很乐意...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BD85FC64FE5863D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"Zanie","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔娜":{"text":"Alna","source":"阿尔娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":2}}